   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law, in relation to authorizing the county of Chenango\nto establish hotel and motel taxes",
    "basePrintNo": "S4419",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4419-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §1202-ff, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S4419\n\nSPONSOR: SEWARD\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the tax law, in relation to authoriz-\ning the county of Chenango to establish hotel and motel taxes\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nThe bill authorizes the county of Chenango to establish hotel and motel\ntaxes.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1. Tax law is amended by adding a new section 1202-ff to author-\nize an occupancy tax in Chenango County, and outlines the terms and\nconditions of such authorization.\n\nSection 2. Provides for the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe bill has been requested by the Chenango County Board of Supervisors\nby Resolution No. 35-19 to authorize the county, by local law, to impose\na four percent hotel/motel/bed and breakfast occupancy tax to fund tour-\nism initiatives and economic development. The county will have to enact\nits own local law.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the state\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediate\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
